    <string name="section_setup">How it works</string>
    <string name="help_body">1. On your PC, run the setup in the relay folder. It deploys a small relay to your Cloudflare account (free plan) and adds a sender to Claude Code\'s status line.\n2. Scan the QR code it shows with this phone and tap \"Open in app\". The connection is filled in for you.\n3. Each time Claude Code replies, its 5-hour and weekly limit values are sent to the relay, and this app picks them up every 15–30 minutes.\n\nUsage from claude.ai or the desktop/mobile apps alone shows up after Claude Code\'s next reply. Once a reset time passes, the widget switches to \"Reset\" by itself.</string>
    <string name="unofficial_note">Unofficial app. Not affiliated with or endorsed by Anthropic. It never sees your Claude login.</string>
